    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUT AUGUST 18</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/697b552bdfba79ff702aac4b9788bf08.avif?t=1755774430\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Empire</strong> is a fast-paced, tactical twist on chess where gold, upgrades, and fog of war change every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>core rules</strong> are familiar-you command the classic board and pieces-but now every turn earns you gold: <strong>1</strong> for moving, <strong>2</strong> for captures, and <strong>3</strong> for taking down upgraded pieces. Spend it in the shop to recruit new units or unlock powerful upgrades that transform how pieces play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of war hides anything outside the vision range of your farthest pieces, making information as valuable as material. Position smartly, scout aggressively, and strike when your opponent is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your army to unleash unique abilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promoted Pawns</strong> \u2013 Attack forward as well as diagonally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bishops</strong> \u2013 Fire arrows to capture from range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights</strong> \u2013 Strike any tile exactly two spaces away and see farther than most units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooks</strong> \u2013 Hit two enemies in a line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Queens</strong> \u2013 Unleash a 1-tile radius AoE, wiping out clusters in one strike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold-Based Economy</strong> \u2013 Plan your spending between units and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Unit Powers</strong> \u2013 Transform the battlefield with ranged, AoE, and vision bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fog of War</strong> \u2013 Ambush and outmaneuver your opponent through controlled vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized &amp; Readable</strong> \u2013 Clean semi-cartoon visuals and a crisp stone battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think faster, see farther, and build the ultimate army.<br>Welcome to <strong>Chess Empire</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Empire</strong> is a fast-paced, tactical twist on chess where gold, upgrades, and fog of war change every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/3e41f54402a25dcbf4fee55520269339.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>core rules</strong> are familiar-you command the classic board and pieces-but now every turn earns you gold: <strong>1</strong> for moving, <strong>2</strong> for captures, and <strong>3</strong> for taking down upgraded pieces. Spend it in the shop to recruit new units or unlock powerful upgrades that transform how pieces play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of war hides anything outside the vision range of your farthest pieces, making information as valuable as material. Position smartly, scout aggressively, and strike when your opponent is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/5a631e243ae70a62e379d6ec98791867.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your army to unleash unique abilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promoted Pawns</strong> \u2013 Attack forward as well as diagonally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bishops</strong> \u2013 Fire arrows to capture from range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights</strong> \u2013 Strike any tile exactly two spaces away and see farther than most units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooks</strong> \u2013 Hit two enemies in a line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Queens</strong> \u2013 Unleash a 1-tile radius AoE, wiping out clusters in one strike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.poster.avif?t=1755774430\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.webm?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794290/extras/8e19b61d6b1c573a426577dc180d7e8d.mp4?t=1755774430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold-Based Economy</strong> \u2013 Plan your spending between units and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Unit Powers</strong> \u2013 Transform the battlefield with ranged, AoE, and vision bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fog of War</strong> \u2013 Ambush and outmaneuver your opponent through controlled vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized &amp; Readable</strong> \u2013 Clean semi-cartoon visuals and a crisp stone battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think faster, see farther, and build the ultimate army.<br>Welcome to <strong>Chess Empire</strong>.</p>",
